<test1>
<ptxt>With the engine stopped, turn the IG ON.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Following the SST (TaSCAN) screen display, select [Active Test] - [Electric Fan].</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt> Perform [ON/OFF].</ptxt>
